      "blocks": {
        "item0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "R Baker",
            "text": "<p>This review is pertaining to the <strong>doggy daycare</strong> service above the cafe. I've been taking my dog there since she was a puppy, and the ladies who care for the dogs there are absolutely stellar. Total professionals, they really are qualified and understand dogs and how to manage them, socialize them and make sure they have a fabulous time. They also make sure the dogs have \"downtime\" and opportunities to rest in between play. Which mean your dog come home exhausted, but not \"wired\" if that makes sense! My dog loves being there so much, and it's worth every penny. Can recommend them highly enough.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/5stars.png",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#505C31",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Stacy Samberg",
            "text": "<p>My mini schnauzer, Hilde, goes to Love my Human twice a week for daycare on the days I work from home. She loves it so much, it really makes me so happy taking her there. When we get there she runs up the stairs and goes crazy when she gets to the room with all her ‘friends’. Not only am I so happy that she seems to love it there, but the girls who work in the daycare are so good with her and all the dogs. I feel very comfortable as I know I’m leaving her in very good hands!</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/5stars.png",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#505C31",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "item2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Cate Archer",
            "text": "<p>Our dog Roobarb always has the best time ever, playing with pawsome pals, at Love My Human Townhouse. The trained and qualified dog nanny team, led by Natasha, are incredibly knowledgeable, kind, caring and acutely attentive to all aspects of the pups in their trusted care. I have complete confidence in all that they share. Roobarb literally runs up their stairs, with such excitement, desperate to enter the playroom - this, in itself, is a clear and fabulous illustration of how happy Roobarb is to be in the care of Love My Human Townhouse pup club. So, this is Roobarb’s review, just as much as it’s mine, and we both give Love My Human Townhouse a top star rating!</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/5stars.png",
            "style": "filled",
            "title_size": 18,
            "title_font": "body",
            "background": "#505C31",
            "text_color": "#FCF7EB",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
